[tldr
  [doc [#
docs-src/site/tldr.cxd — the one lead of why to reach for CX (RULED: DOCS-49,
RS-30; the design's voice rule 2).

One sentence lives in one place. scripts/gen_docs/primer_build.cx projects this
file into the three pages that open with it — the landing page
(docs-src/site/index.md: `{{TLDR:lead}}`, the lead alone as the hero's lede
since HOME-1; the clauses' cases are the guide home's and the primer's), the
guide home (scripts/gen_guide/guide_build.cx, tldr-html) and the primer's §0
(docs-src/llm/primer.md.tmpl, `{{TLDR}}`) — so the three cannot drift apart
the way the three hand copies they replace had.

The lead carries no label: each page opens on its sentence as plain prose,
and docs-src/site/vocabulary.cxd refuses the label's return (RULED: DOCS-51
§1 and §7, DOCS-43).

  [lead]      the opening paragraph: why to reach for CX, in our voice
  [standard]  the standard we hold ourselves to, stated as ours — each clause
              below is one of its terms with the fixture that proves it
  [clause]    one claim, and the conformance case (`fixture=`) the page
              replays for it when it is built; the case must come from a
              suite both docs-src/site/manifest.cxd's and
              docs-src/llm/manifest.cxd's [suites] declare, because both
              projections replay it (a moved output stops either build)

The prose carries the site's inline Markdown (**bold**, `code`); the HTML
projection renders exactly those two forms.
#]]

  [lead [#
Reach for CX whenever the data is the point. One bracketed syntax is the document, the query, the program and the compiler's own tree, so the file you read is the file you transform, validate, hash, store and serve — with no second language in between.
#]]

  [standard [#
We hold ourselves to a standard we can state in one line — **readable on day one, batteries included, exact by default, and effects you grant rather than inherit** — and we prove each term of it with a conformance case this page replayed when it was built:
#]]

  [clause fixture=program-for-003-name-email-pair [#
a query is a pattern over the document, not code over an object model
#]]
  [clause fixture=ap-decimal-float-mix-right [#
a fraction literal is an exact decimal, and mixing one with a binary float is refused out loud rather than rounded in silence
#]]
  [clause fixture=program-construction-err-004-captured-err-propagates [#
an error is a value that propagates out of whatever is built from it — no exception unwinds past you
#]]
  [clause fixture=io-001-read-file-cap-denied [#
a program reads nothing it was not granted, and the denial is a value naming the flag that would allow it
#]]
  [clause fixture=re-003-compile-backreference-unsupported [#
a regular expression cannot backtrack, so no input can make it run for as long as it likes
#]]
  [clause fixture=store-rt-001-round-trip-get [#
state that outlives the program is two calls to a content-addressed store
#]]
  [clause fixture=mcp-001-call-tool-request-shape [#
an agent-protocol message is an ordinary value projected to its wire form
#]]
]
